Meta.documentation:dawn
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:Dawn itself, as a resource.
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:The meta resource: a Dawn interpreter reachable from inside Dawn, so Dawn
Meta.documentation:programs can construct and run Dawn programs (source in, results out). The
Meta.documentation:foundation of self-hosting (Phase 3) and the future chat harness (Phase 7).
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@example
